Package: pfadfinder
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pil, python3-numpy, python3-requests, bluez, gpsd, iw, fonts-dejavu-core, rtl-sdr, python3-serial, python3-pycryptodome, python3-yaml, python3-pubsub
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Wardriver for the M5Stack CardputerZero
 Logs Wi-Fi and Bluetooth networks with GPS, aircraft with an RTL-SDR and
 the mesh nodes a Meshtastic or MeshCore device on USB hears, and uploads
 them to WiGLE, WDGWars and Wardrift. Uses USB dongles when
 present and the internal radios otherwise. Runs as a background service
 with a keyboard UI.
